#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:2
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:14
msgid "Mobile VPN options"
msgstr "모바일 VPN 옵션"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:7
msgid ""
"To connect to your private network Mattermost instance, you need to set "
"up a way to connect to your private network Mattermost instance, using an"
" external proxy with encrypted transport through HTTPS and WSS network "
"connections."
msgstr ""
"사설 네트워크의 OKR.BEST 인스턴스에 연결하려면, HTTPS와 WSS 네트워크 연결을 "
"통한 암호화 전송을 지원하는 외부 프록시를 사용해 사설 네트워크의 OKR.BEST "
"인스턴스에 연결하는 방법을 설정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:9
msgid ""
"Depending on your security policies, we recommend deploying Mattermost "
"behind a VPN and using a `per-app VPN <#id3>`_ with your EMM provider, or"
" a mobile VPN client."
msgstr ""
"보안 정책에 따라 OKR.BEST를 VPN 뒤에 배포하고 EMM 공급자와 함께 `앱별 VPN "
"<#id3>`_\\ 을 사용하거나 모바일 VPN 클라이언트를 사용할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:11
msgid ""
"Also consider deploying a mobile VPN client with multi-factor "
"authentication (MFA) to your preferred login method, such as GitLab SSO "
"with MFA, or run Mattermost Enterprise Edition with :doc:`multi-factor "
"authentication (MFA) </administration-guide/onboard/multi-factor-"
"authentication>` enabled."
msgstr ""
"또한 MFA가 적용된 GitLab SSO처럼 선호하는 로그인 방식에 다단계 인증(MFA)을 "
"적용한 모바일 VPN 클라이언트를 배포하거나, :doc:`다단계 인증(MFA) "
"</administration-guide/onboard/multi-factor-authentication>`\\ 을 활성화한 "
"Mattermost Enterprise Edition을 실행하는 것을 고려하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:16
msgid ""
"A Virtual Private Network (VPN) allows a device outside a firewall to "
"access content inside the firewall as if it were on the same network."
msgstr ""
"가상 사설망(VPN)은 방화벽 밖의 기기가 마치 같은 네트워크에 있는 것처럼 방화벽 "
"내부의 콘텐츠에 접근할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:19
msgid ""
"Some mobile VPN options depend on the requirements of your organization "
"and the demands and/or the needs of your users."
msgstr ""
"일부 모바일 VPN 옵션은 조직의 요구 사항과 사용자의 요구·필요에 따라 "
"달라집니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:21
msgid ""
"We recommend one of two options: `per-app VPN <#id3>`_ or a `device VPN "
"<#id4>`_ to secure your deployment. Both options are compatible with most"
" EMM providers."
msgstr ""
"배포를 보호하기 위해 `앱별 VPN <#id3>`_ 또는 `기기 VPN <#id4>`_ 두 옵션 중 "
"하나를 권장합니다. 두 옵션 모두 대부분의 EMM 공급자와 호환됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:23
msgid ""
"We also recommend you review the following :doc:`commonly-asked questions"
" </deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-faq>` about data security on mobile "
"devices:"
msgstr ""
"또한 모바일 기기의 데이터 보안에 대한 다음 :doc:`자주 묻는 질문 </deployment-"
"guide/mobile/mobile-faq>`\\ 을 검토할 것을 권장합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:25
msgid "How data is handled on a device after an account is deleted?"
msgstr "계정이 삭제된 후 기기에서 데이터가 어떻게 처리되나요?"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:26
msgid "What post metadata is sent in mobile push notifications?"
msgstr "모바일 푸시 알림에는 어떤 글 메타데이터가 전송되나요?"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:27
msgid "What are my options for securing the Mobile apps?"
msgstr "모바일 앱을 보호하기 위한 옵션은 무엇인가요?"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:28
msgid "What are my options for securing push notifications?"
msgstr "푸시 알림을 보호하기 위한 옵션은 무엇인가요?"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:31
msgid "Per-app VPN"
msgstr "앱별 VPN"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:33
msgid ""
"A common approach is to use a per-app VPN. This provides a connection to "
"the VPN when needed (on-demand). If using a per-app VPN with Mattermost, "
"you can configure the following options:"
msgstr ""
"일반적인 방식은 앱별 VPN을 사용하는 것입니다. 이는 필요할 때(온디맨드) VPN "
"연결을 제공합니다. OKR.BEST에서 앱별 VPN을 사용하는 경우 다음 옵션을 구성할 수 "
"있습니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:35
msgid ""
"**useVPN:** Mattermost waits until the connection to the VPN server is "
"established before making any requests (otherwise they will fail). This "
"is only supported on iOS as Android OS cannot support waiting. It still "
"works but the first connection attempt may fail."
msgstr ""
"**useVPN:** OKR.BEST는 VPN 서버 연결이 설정될 때까지 기다린 후 요청을 "
"보냅니다(그렇지 않으면 요청이 실패합니다). Android OS는 대기를 지원하지 "
"못하므로 이 기능은 iOS에서만 지원됩니다. Android에서도 작동은 하지만 첫 연결 "
"시도가 실패할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:36
msgid ""
"**timeoutVPN (iOS only):** How long to wait for the connection to the VPN"
" server before trying."
msgstr ""
"**timeoutVPN(iOS 전용):** 시도하기 전에 VPN 서버 연결을 얼마나 기다릴지 "
"설정합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:39
msgid "Device VPN"
msgstr "기기 VPN"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:41
msgid ""
"With this option, all internet traffic routes through the VPN specified "
"in the profile. This could cause issues for personal applications."
msgstr ""
"이 옵션을 사용하면 모든 인터넷 트래픽이 프로필에 지정된 VPN을 통해 "
"라우팅됩니다. 이는 개인 애플리케이션에 문제를 일으킬 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:44
msgid "Connect via corporate proxy server"
msgstr "기업 프록시 서버를 통한 연결"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:46
msgid ""
"Review the following commonly-asked questions about connecting through a "
"corporate proxy server:"
msgstr "기업 프록시 서버를 통한 연결에 대한 다음 자주 묻는 질문을 검토하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:48
msgid ""
":ref:`How do I receive mobile push notifications if my IT policy requires"
" the use of a corporate proxy server? <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-"
"faq:how do i receive mobile push notifications if my it policy requires "
"the use of a corporate proxy server?>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`IT 정책상 기업 프록시 서버를 사용해야 하는 경우 모바일 푸시 알림을 "
"어떻게 받나요? <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-faq:how do i receive mobile "
"push notifications if my it policy requires the use of a corporate proxy "
"server?>`"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:49
msgid ""
":ref:`Deploy Mattermost with connection restricted post-proxy relay in "
"DMZ or a trusted cloud environment <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-"
"faq:deploy mattermost with connection restricted post-proxy relay in dmz "
"or a trusted cloud environment>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`DMZ 또는 신뢰할 수 있는 클라우드 환경에서 연결이 제한된 포스트 프록시 "
"릴레이로 OKR.BEST 배포 <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-faq:deploy "
"mattermost with connection restricted post-proxy relay in dmz or a "
"trusted cloud environment>`"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/consider-mobile-vpn-options.rst:50
msgid ""
":ref:`Whitelist Mattermost push notification proxy to bypass your "
"corporate proxy server <deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-faq:whitelist "
"mattermost push notification proxy to bypass your corporate proxy "
"server>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`기업 프록시 서버를 우회하도록 OKR.BEST 푸시 알림 프록시 허용 목록 추가 "
"<deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-faq:whitelist mattermost push "
"notification proxy to bypass your corporate proxy server>`"

